         <div type="image">
            <p rend="center">
               <pb facs="MS-SCHNITZLER-B-00043-B-00002-000-00061" />
               <hi rend="pre-print">
                  <rs ref="#pmb445" type="place">Roma</rs>
                  <space unit="chars" quantity="1" />
                  <rs type="place" ref="#pmb44225">Monte Pincio</rs> – passeggiata</hi>
            </p>
         </div>
         <div type="writingSession" n="1">
            <opener>
               <dateline rend="right">
                  <pb facs="MS-SCHNITZLER-B-00043-B-00002-000-00062" />
                  <date>7/X.</date>
                  <lb />
                  <rs ref="#pmb623" type="place">
                     <hi rend="latintype">Hôtel Hassler</hi>
                  </rs>.</dateline>
            </opener>
            <p>Es fällt mir der ſchöne <anchor type="commentary" xml:id="K_L01239-1" />Tag<note type="commentary" corresp="K_L01239-1">
                  <ref target="1902-07-03" type="schnitzler-tagebuch" subtype="See" />.
               </note> ein, wo wir durchs <rs type="place" ref="#pmb607">Stubaithal</rs> gegangen
               ſind und ſo viel geredet haben. Wie gehts Ihnen?</p>
            <closer>Ihr<lb />
               <signed>Hugo</signed>
            </closer>
         </div>
